cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this index or dataset, please cite the companion paper below."
title: "A Climate Policy Uncertainty (CPU) Index for Portugal"
abstract: >-
  A search-based Climate Policy Uncertainty (CPU) index for Portugal,
  constructed following Baker, Bloom, and Davis (2016) and Gavriilidis (2021) by
  measuring the frequency of news articles jointly referencing climate and clean
  energy, the policy-making process, and uncertainty.
type: dataset
authors:
